WEBVTT

00:00:06.610 --> 00:00:12.360
<b>Kunato Family Grave</b>

00:01:04.390 --> 00:01:05.610
I see.

00:01:12.670 --> 00:01:18.300
<b>List of Kunato Hyoma Supporters</b>

00:01:12.670 --> 00:01:18.300
<b>-san</b>

00:01:12.670 --> 00:01:18.300
<b>• Nagi</b>

00:01:12.670 --> 00:01:18.300
<b>• Kagami</b>

00:01:12.670 --> 00:01:18.300
<b>• Suzuri</b>

00:01:12.670 --> 00:01:18.300
<b>• Haori</b>

00:01:12.670 --> 00:01:18.300
<b>• Kushige</b>

00:01:13.190 --> 00:01:16.280
The third day is here...

00:01:25.170 --> 00:01:27.060
They're messing with us.

00:01:27.060 --> 00:01:30.060
Those damned Nagatsuki traitors!

00:01:30.060 --> 00:01:34.760
They're boosting their forces? 
Talkin' about crackdowns?!

00:01:34.760 --> 00:01:37.570
They think they can boss us around, huh?!

00:01:37.920 --> 00:01:39.160
Hikaki...

00:01:39.160 --> 00:01:42.830
That talk of them taking in new recruits

00:01:43.260 --> 00:01:45.080
is nothing but rumors.

00:01:47.110 --> 00:01:49.430
Still, more than enough of an excuse.

00:01:50.140 --> 00:01:53.210
So-called tsukumogami sucking up to humans,

00:01:53.210 --> 00:01:55.590
doing what they're told by hunting us down...

00:01:55.590 --> 00:02:01.350
What could feel better than 
taking those freaks down a peg?!

00:02:04.170 --> 00:02:07.000
So let's go for it...

00:02:08.130 --> 00:02:10.070
Let's have a Nagatsuki hunt!

00:02:25.870 --> 00:02:33.630
<i>Malevolent Spirits</i>

00:03:46.990 --> 00:03:52.000
<b>Overflow</b>

00:04:05.330 --> 00:04:08.470
I heard you saved Kagami yesterday.

00:04:08.860 --> 00:04:13.110
She was over the moon 
about you carrying her like that.

00:04:19.280 --> 00:04:20.440
Thanks for doing that.

00:04:20.760 --> 00:04:23.130
She couldn't sign my approval dead.

00:04:23.130 --> 00:04:25.400
It was a logical response 
from that perspective.

00:04:25.400 --> 00:04:26.700
Oh, is that why?

00:04:34.720 --> 00:04:35.670
Say...

00:04:37.210 --> 00:04:41.960
About today's... you know. The time limit.

00:04:41.960 --> 00:04:45.420
I think maybe I was a little unfair with you.

00:04:47.270 --> 00:04:48.460
So...

00:04:48.960 --> 00:04:51.880
It didn't feel unfair to me.

00:04:51.880 --> 00:04:53.600
I agreed to it myself.

00:04:55.010 --> 00:04:57.100
I won't go back on that now.

00:04:59.170 --> 00:05:00.110
Sure.

00:05:01.030 --> 00:05:02.360
Well, then...

00:05:02.780 --> 00:05:05.500
I don't know quite what to say...

00:05:06.310 --> 00:05:07.360
Do your best.

00:05:09.300 --> 00:05:10.360
I will.

00:05:11.180 --> 00:05:13.580
Do you have your university classes today?

00:05:13.580 --> 00:05:14.250
Yeah.

00:05:14.620 --> 00:05:16.820
Spring courses and all that.

00:05:20.090 --> 00:05:21.250
Hey, c'mon.

00:05:21.630 --> 00:05:23.260
It all comes down to Yu.

00:05:23.260 --> 00:05:24.750
You think so?

00:05:24.750 --> 00:05:28.260
Haori and Kushige were 
never opposed to taking him in.

00:05:28.650 --> 00:05:30.900
So Yu's gonna be the biggest hurdle.

00:05:31.470 --> 00:05:36.200
And Hyoma's behavior that first day was 
pretty much tailor-made to piss off Yu.

00:05:36.730 --> 00:05:39.240
And she's already stone-cold on a good day.

00:05:40.350 --> 00:05:43.450
But Hyoma-san really 
stepped on a landmine, right?

00:05:43.450 --> 00:05:46.320
When it comes to Botan, Yu-chan gets so...

00:05:46.320 --> 00:05:47.870
That's right.

00:05:47.870 --> 00:05:49.290
Anyway...

00:05:49.710 --> 00:05:53.070
Let's wrap up work quickly 
and check on their progress.

00:05:53.070 --> 00:05:56.390
He'll need a major coup to earn her approval.

00:05:57.370 --> 00:06:00.520
Of course, from a pure 
personality perspective,

00:06:00.520 --> 00:06:03.450
they're not the worst pairing in the world.

00:06:04.270 --> 00:06:07.620
They might run into something 
that flips things on their head.

00:06:09.280 --> 00:06:10.590
You're late.

00:06:10.940 --> 00:06:13.690
I finished the job already.

00:06:16.750 --> 00:06:18.520
Are they still alive?

00:06:18.520 --> 00:06:21.400
Yes. Just bound up.

00:06:22.630 --> 00:06:24.630
Then, once I've restrained them...

00:06:25.360 --> 00:06:26.650
<b>Proxy</b>

00:06:34.020 --> 00:06:35.050
Seal.

00:06:36.500 --> 00:06:37.790
Proxy

00:06:43.330 --> 00:06:44.750
And then it's over.

00:06:44.750 --> 00:06:47.300
Your aid won't be required.

00:06:47.790 --> 00:06:50.760
Of course, even if you 
had helped in some way,

00:06:51.480 --> 00:06:54.650
I doubt it would do anything 
to change my opinion of you.

00:06:56.080 --> 00:06:57.140
I see.

00:06:57.610 --> 00:06:59.510
I was certainly getting that impression.

00:07:00.380 --> 00:07:05.510
That's right. I utterly despise you...

00:07:05.980 --> 00:07:07.900
Kunato Hyoma.

00:07:08.280 --> 00:07:12.070
The way your eyes watch us 
with unwavering hatred...

00:07:13.210 --> 00:07:16.490
The way you carry yourself, 
so brimming with loathing...

00:07:17.040 --> 00:07:18.410
And most of all...

00:07:21.380 --> 00:07:24.500
The way you hurt my mistress.

00:07:26.830 --> 00:07:29.910
You have two options regarding my signature.

00:07:31.480 --> 00:07:33.510
One is to give up on receiving it.

00:07:33.890 --> 00:07:35.190
The other is...

00:07:48.100 --> 00:07:51.110
Defeat me here,

00:07:51.110 --> 00:07:53.030
and take it by force.

00:07:55.140 --> 00:07:57.370
In other words, "might makes right."

00:07:57.880 --> 00:08:01.120
The latter seems simpler and more decisive.

00:08:05.280 --> 00:08:07.250
Shall we proceed with that?

00:08:17.930 --> 00:08:20.430
Spirit energy. They're close!

00:08:22.450 --> 00:08:25.940
That's them for sure... the Nagatsuki!

00:08:26.780 --> 00:08:28.410
Nagi, is that...

00:08:28.410 --> 00:08:29.440
Yeah.

00:08:30.150 --> 00:08:33.200
Yu's let herself get completely distracted.

00:08:33.530 --> 00:08:37.430
If she's really lost her temper, 
Hyoma could be in trouble.

00:08:39.620 --> 00:08:41.950
Patrol time is over.

00:09:11.990 --> 00:09:13.110
Is that...

00:09:17.210 --> 00:09:19.120
A pin for binding up hair?

00:09:27.560 --> 00:09:29.580
Don't just run away.

00:09:29.580 --> 00:09:31.590
By all means, fight back.

00:09:31.880 --> 00:09:35.130
Strike the hated tsukumogami 
down without a second thought.

00:09:35.840 --> 00:09:38.840
Isn't that how you've 
always done it in the past?

00:09:39.750 --> 00:09:44.150
I was sent here under orders 
to change that about myself.

00:09:46.020 --> 00:09:47.600
Were you?

00:09:58.000 --> 00:10:02.200
I saw no sign of that in 
your demeanor the first day.

00:10:09.100 --> 00:10:12.460
Your bloodthirsty true self, 
hostile to everything around you...

00:10:13.710 --> 00:10:15.340
Why not reveal it?!

00:10:44.530 --> 00:10:48.170
Even now, you won't fight back?

00:10:49.750 --> 00:10:53.280
Kunato Zohei told me to watch you.

00:10:54.170 --> 00:10:56.680
I've been around you for two days.

00:10:57.630 --> 00:11:00.550
Indeed, I'm starting to realize...

00:11:01.450 --> 00:11:04.980
There's something different 
about the lot of you.

00:11:05.950 --> 00:11:13.400
I'm starting to feel it would be premature 
to fight you until I figure out what that is.

00:11:21.220 --> 00:11:22.240
Tch.

00:11:23.190 --> 00:11:27.590
I see that this is a waste of time.

00:11:31.370 --> 00:11:36.630
I've been watching your grandson 
in the two days since he arrived,

00:11:37.170 --> 00:11:39.880
and I think that he can safely remain here.

00:11:39.880 --> 00:11:43.140
That is, assuming he can 
surmount this day's challenge...

00:11:44.200 --> 00:11:47.640
But are you truly certain 
this is what you want?

00:11:48.060 --> 00:11:49.390
What do you mean?

00:11:49.390 --> 00:11:54.040
<i>To overcome and accept means...</i>

00:11:54.850 --> 00:11:57.650
It might be necessary for both of them.

00:11:58.520 --> 00:12:01.150
But there is one thing.

00:12:01.970 --> 00:12:03.900
His burden of darkness

00:12:04.760 --> 00:12:06.810
is far darker than it may first appear.

00:12:08.850 --> 00:12:11.520
He's quite a handful as grandsons go,

00:12:11.520 --> 00:12:14.420
but I do hope you'll watch over him,

00:12:14.420 --> 00:12:15.820
<i>Haori-san.</i>

00:12:16.480 --> 00:12:19.160
There's nothing I wouldn't do for Kunato Zohei.

00:12:20.170 --> 00:12:22.620
So? What now?

00:12:23.760 --> 00:12:27.930
If you won't force my hand, 
will you give up and leave?

00:12:30.040 --> 00:12:31.690
Half of the day remains.

00:12:33.730 --> 00:12:36.730
A suitable amount of time in which to bond.

00:12:39.720 --> 00:12:42.740
<i>What makes him so confident?</i>

00:12:42.740 --> 00:12:48.760
Still, the rage you felt toward 
someone who made light of a friend...

00:12:48.760 --> 00:12:50.870
That's a very human reaction.

00:12:51.180 --> 00:12:54.000
You love Nagatsuki-san, don't you?

00:12:58.900 --> 00:12:59.590
I...

00:13:00.250 --> 00:13:01.260
I...

00:13:03.460 --> 00:13:05.010
How could you say that to me?!

00:13:10.930 --> 00:13:14.520
What are you doing?!

00:13:15.770 --> 00:13:18.270
Found us a Nagatsuki!

00:13:18.270 --> 00:13:20.770
Yu! Calm down!

00:13:23.400 --> 00:13:24.990
This little...

00:13:24.990 --> 00:13:25.950
annoying human fly!

00:13:26.950 --> 00:13:28.200
Hyoma-san?!

00:13:34.450 --> 00:13:36.460
What's this, now?

00:13:42.530 --> 00:13:45.470
Well, ain't that interesting...

00:13:45.470 --> 00:13:49.000
Did you come here just to see us?

00:13:49.470 --> 00:13:52.720
Couldn't ask for a better chance 
to crush your whole crew.

00:13:53.890 --> 00:13:56.870
What was that, you cocky rooster wannabe?

00:13:58.590 --> 00:13:59.950
Hey, Yu.

00:13:59.950 --> 00:14:01.830
What's going on here?

00:14:02.760 --> 00:14:06.610
What're these guys so pissed about?

00:14:06.970 --> 00:14:09.130
What'd they come after you for?

00:14:10.120 --> 00:14:12.040
What did you do?

00:14:12.040 --> 00:14:14.490
Don't be absurd, you gorilla.

00:14:14.490 --> 00:14:18.220
I'd just finished my duel with Hyoma-san 
when they arrived without warning.

00:14:18.220 --> 00:14:20.090
Just like the lot of you.

00:14:20.090 --> 00:14:21.490
I see.

00:14:21.490 --> 00:14:23.380
<i>So they </i>were<i> fighting...</i>

00:14:23.960 --> 00:14:26.300
So you were with Hyoma? Where is he now?!

00:14:29.300 --> 00:14:30.420
Right there.

00:14:35.770 --> 00:14:39.520
<b>— Hikaki —</b>

00:14:37.170 --> 00:14:39.520
Shut the hell up already.

00:14:39.950 --> 00:14:43.230
I make up my mind to have a Nagatsuki hunt, 
and then run into the lot of them!

00:14:43.230 --> 00:14:44.270
Talk about good luck!

00:14:44.270 --> 00:14:45.790
And now...

00:14:45.790 --> 00:14:47.280
I'll kill you all!

00:14:47.710 --> 00:14:49.030
Time out.

00:14:51.170 --> 00:14:52.640
Anyway, Yu.

00:14:52.640 --> 00:14:54.410
Get that idiot out of there first.

00:14:56.660 --> 00:14:58.060
Did you call him an idiot?

00:14:58.060 --> 00:15:00.410
He can hear you in there, you know.

00:15:01.590 --> 00:15:04.360
Shut up! I'll apologize later!

00:15:05.760 --> 00:15:07.980
What do we do about these?

00:15:08.440 --> 00:15:11.120
Looks like your run-of-the-mill 
punk tsukumogami.

00:15:11.120 --> 00:15:13.930
Just gotta take 'em out, right?

00:15:14.870 --> 00:15:16.180
I get it now.

00:15:16.180 --> 00:15:20.690
You seem pretty attached 
to that human from before...

00:15:22.190 --> 00:15:24.690
Then just stay where you are.

00:15:24.690 --> 00:15:25.940
Yattoko!

00:15:24.730 --> 00:15:25.940
<b>— Yattoko —</b>

00:15:25.940 --> 00:15:27.190
Koyori!

00:15:25.980 --> 00:15:27.190
<b>— Koyori —</b>

00:15:27.190 --> 00:15:28.440
Kaginawa!

00:15:27.230 --> 00:15:28.440
<b>— Kaginawa —</b>

00:15:28.830 --> 00:15:29.950
That human there!

00:15:29.950 --> 00:15:32.950
Beat 'em to it and kill the guy!

00:15:33.670 --> 00:15:35.830
Who does something like that?

00:15:36.400 --> 00:15:38.330
We'll get there before you do!

00:15:41.310 --> 00:15:42.080
Yu!

00:15:42.480 --> 00:15:44.580
Yes. I'll take care of it!

00:15:46.110 --> 00:15:46.880
Suzuri!

00:15:46.880 --> 00:15:47.640
Right!

00:15:54.800 --> 00:15:57.060
Kushige, let's head out for a while.

00:15:57.400 --> 00:15:59.320
I heard from Kagami.

00:15:59.320 --> 00:16:02.590
Hostile tsukumogami interrupted their patrol.

00:16:02.590 --> 00:16:05.740
That's not unusual in and of itself,

00:16:05.740 --> 00:16:08.570
but I'm curious as to the 
mettle of the attackers.

00:16:09.540 --> 00:16:13.800
It might reveal to us the core 
of Hyoma-san's character.

00:16:17.440 --> 00:16:18.280
I'm in range!

00:16:19.320 --> 00:16:20.410
Die!

00:16:24.750 --> 00:16:27.100
I can't let that happen. Sorry.

00:16:40.360 --> 00:16:41.270
A projecting mirror?

00:16:47.890 --> 00:16:48.770
Yu-chan!

00:16:48.770 --> 00:16:51.280
Someone's moving around inside the building!

00:16:59.430 --> 00:17:00.700
You...

00:17:09.670 --> 00:17:12.990
What, is that the best you've got?!

00:17:12.990 --> 00:17:16.090
Seems like serving human masters 
all day might've made you soft!

00:17:16.560 --> 00:17:22.600
No need for trash talk. As Saenome proxies,
 we'll gladly give you all we've got.

00:17:23.020 --> 00:17:25.520
But I want to confirm one thing...

00:17:27.530 --> 00:17:30.120
You ordered your comrades to kill the human,

00:17:30.670 --> 00:17:34.030
and they showed no hesitation 
to follow that order.

00:17:35.040 --> 00:17:40.030
Does that mean you've killed humans before?

00:17:40.030 --> 00:17:45.540
Oh, we got bored of that 
little game <i>long</i> ago!

00:17:45.540 --> 00:17:49.520
We don't like how humans 
exploit the objects we possess,

00:17:49.520 --> 00:17:51.540
so we had a little fun with 'em!

00:17:51.840 --> 00:17:53.840
Talk about a letdown, though!

00:17:53.840 --> 00:17:56.990
Every single one just 
started cryin' in seconds!

00:17:56.990 --> 00:17:58.800
Where's the fun in that?!

00:17:59.180 --> 00:18:02.940
Seeing the lot of you pal around with 
those weaklings... it pisses me off!

00:18:09.040 --> 00:18:09.850
What was that?!

00:18:10.160 --> 00:18:11.230
Hyoma!

00:18:16.570 --> 00:18:20.240
Is he... trying to extract himself?

00:18:26.640 --> 00:18:28.250
K-Kill him!

00:18:28.250 --> 00:18:30.520
He might be kinda tough!

00:18:49.350 --> 00:18:50.590
He broke him.

00:18:51.520 --> 00:18:52.900
Is it that power again?

00:18:57.030 --> 00:18:58.600
I see.

00:19:00.310 --> 00:19:01.690
Your gang...

00:19:03.160 --> 00:19:05.770
They've killed humans?!

00:19:40.420 --> 00:19:43.530
You're pretty awesome...

00:19:43.870 --> 00:19:46.910
Just like us... right?

00:19:47.460 --> 00:19:51.210
You love killing. You enjoy it!

00:19:51.210 --> 00:19:53.260
It's written on your face!

00:19:53.670 --> 00:19:56.670
Yes, that's right.

00:19:57.640 --> 00:20:00.040
It's what I've wanted for so long.

00:20:02.420 --> 00:20:04.660
Tsukumogami like you...

00:20:05.300 --> 00:20:07.390
This time, I'll destroy you.

00:20:09.040 --> 00:20:10.060
I'll destroy you...

00:20:10.810 --> 00:20:12.190
and this time...

00:20:14.490 --> 00:20:15.650
protect them!

00:20:20.880 --> 00:20:22.510
I see.

00:20:22.510 --> 00:20:24.870
So that's the core of Hyoma-san.

00:20:26.190 --> 00:20:31.260
The resentment and hatred 
he feels truly does run deep.

00:20:31.660 --> 00:20:35.400
It's constant and unabating.

00:20:36.240 --> 00:20:41.450
Yes... I'm sure he sees all of 
us tsukumogami the same way.

00:20:41.920 --> 00:20:45.930
That we bring nothing but harm 
to the land of the living.

00:20:47.140 --> 00:20:48.180
But...

00:20:48.570 --> 00:20:51.160
I'm seeing the first signs of change here.

00:20:53.200 --> 00:20:56.730
If so, then Zohei-san might be right.

00:20:56.730 --> 00:21:00.690
His twisted heart could yet be corrected.

00:21:01.240 --> 00:21:02.840
But more importantly,

00:21:02.840 --> 00:21:07.450
he could represent hope to us.

00:21:13.710 --> 00:21:15.080
He might just

00:21:18.130 --> 00:21:21.750
be able to save her.

00:21:25.750 --> 00:21:29.220
Once, there was a girl 
saved by tsukumogami...

00:21:29.740 --> 00:21:32.150
And a boy from whom they took everything.

00:21:34.170 --> 00:21:37.290
Does it not make sense that 
the ones to bring them together

00:21:37.290 --> 00:21:38.730
might be tsukumogami, as well?

00:21:39.200 --> 00:21:43.450
The bond it is in our nature to forge...

00:21:44.550 --> 00:21:48.310
I'm glad that we took Hyoma-san on.

00:21:50.500 --> 00:21:53.750
They might make a good match.

00:23:24.920 --> 00:23:39.930
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:24.920 --> 00:23:39.930
<b>Arrangement</b>
